```
```
error[E0609]: no field `sleep` on type `&mut S`
 --> src/lib.rs:4:9
  |
4 |     ctx.sleep = 0;
  |         ^^^^^ unknown field

error[E0308]: mismatched types
 --> src/lib.rs:3:22
  |
3 | fn f(ctx: &mut S) -> String {
